# Only code, README.md and the README's figures are tracked. `make all-sites`
# rebuilds everything else from the R scripts — except Moscow and Voronezh's
# manual exports (below). One site downloads a few to a few dozen MB; all
# fifteen together, about 120 MB.

# Raw source data, every provider — downloaded on demand by stage 00 into
# data/raw/ (castanet) and data/raw/<site>/. All public; none needs credentials.
# Météo-France's filenames encode years and rotate each January; stage 00 reads
# the current names from the mirror (R/sources/meteofrance.R::mf_eras()).
data/raw/

# Moscow and Voronezh's raw data is a MANUAL export from Roshydromet's
# AISORI-M — login-gated, no stable URL, so unlike every other site `make
# all` cannot regenerate it. NOT committed anyway: its licence says personal,
# non-commercial use only, and redistributing the raw file goes beyond that.
# A fresh clone needs the export re-placed in data/raw/<site>/ by hand — see
# each site's "Why only one station?" note and R/sources/meteoru.R.

# Cached station extract + intermediates — regenerable via `make prepare`
data/processed/

# Generated analysis outputs — rebuilt by `make all` / `make all SITE=<site>`.
# Each report is the shareable artifact: copy it out, do not commit it (a
# multi-MB base64 HTML re-inflates the history on every refresh).
# EXCEPTION: every site's five PNG figures ARE tracked, plus the two
# cross-site figures in outputs/compare/figures/. README.md renders them
# inline (see R/03_readme.R, R/04_compare.R) and GitHub can only show figures
# that live in the repository. Figure refreshes are ordinary sequential commits
# (no amend/force-push).
#
# Patterns, not one block per site, so a new site's figures are tracked without
# editing this file: `*` never crosses `/`, and git can re-include a file only
# when its parent directories are not themselves excluded — hence each level
# is reopened as a directory before its files are excluded again. Castanet keeps
# its legacy root path, outputs/figures/.
outputs/*
!outputs/*/
outputs/*/*
!outputs/figures/*.png
!outputs/*/figures/
outputs/*/figures/*
!outputs/*/figures/*.png

# R session cruft
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
*.Rproj

# macOS
.DS_Store

# AI assistant & editor helper artifacts — never commit (local configs / home setup)
.claude/
.cursor/
.aider*
